# ✅ Backend Integration Checklist

## Backend Requirements

Để thực hiện đầy đủ functionality, backend cần:

### 1. Notification Model
```java
@Entity
public class Notification {
    // ... existing fields ...

    @Column(name = "extra_id")  // NEW
    private String extraId;  // Chứa requestId/postId

    // Getters and setters
    public String getExtraId() { return extraId; }
    public void setExtraId(String extraId) { this.extraId = extraId; }
}
```

### 2. API Endpoints

#### Endpoint 1: Get Comment
```java
@GetMapping("/api/comments/{commentId}")
public ResponseEntity<CommentDTO> getComment(@PathVariable String commentId) {
    Comment comment = commentRepo.findById(commentId).orElse(null);
    if (comment != null) {
        CommentDTO dto = new CommentDTO();
        dto.setId(comment.getId());
        dto.setRequestId(comment.getRequest().getId());  // IMPORTANT
        dto.setContent(comment.getContent());
        dto.setDate(comment.getDate());
        dto.setUserId(comment.getUser().getId());
        dto.setUserRole(comment.getUser().getRole());
        return ResponseEntity.ok(dto);
    }
    return ResponseEntity.notFound().build();
}
```

#### Endpoint 2: Get Reaction/Vote
```java
@GetMapping("/api/reactions/{reactionId}")
public ResponseEntity<ReactionDTO> getReaction(@PathVariable String reactionId) {
    Vote vote = voteRepo.findById(reactionId).orElse(null);
    if (vote != null) {
        ReactionDTO dto = new ReactionDTO();
        dto.setId(vote.getId());
        dto.setRequestId(vote.getRequest().getId());  // IMPORTANT
        dto.setReactionType(vote.getReactionType());
        dto.setDate(vote.getDate());
        dto.setUserId(vote.getUser().getId());
        return ResponseEntity.ok(dto);
    }
    return ResponseEntity.notFound().build();
}
```

### 3. Notification Service Updates

#### When Creating from Comment
```java
public void notifyCommentOnPost(Comment comment) {
    Post post = comment.getPost();

    Notification notification = new Notification(
        UUID.randomUUID().toString(),
        "Có bình luận mới trên bài viết của bạn",
        comment.getContent().substring(0, Math.min(50, comment.getContent().length())) + "...",
        "COMMENT_FORUM_POST_NOTIFICATION",
        false,
        LocalDateTime.now()
    );

    notification.setExtraId(post.getId());  // SET REQUEST ID
    notificationRepo.save(notification);
    notificationRepo.addUser(notification.getId(), post.getAuthor().getId());
}
```

#### When Creating from Reaction
```java
public void notifyReactionOnPost(Vote vote) {
    Post post = vote.getPost();

    Notification notification = new Notification(
        UUID.randomUUID().toString(),
        "Có lượt " + vote.getReactionType() + " mới",
        "Bài viết của bạn nhận được lượt " + vote.getReactionType(),
        "VOTE_FORUM_POST_NOTIFICATION",
        false,
        LocalDateTime.now()
    );

    notification.setExtraId(post.getId());  // SET REQUEST ID
    notificationRepo.save(notification);
    notificationRepo.addUser(notification.getId(), post.getAuthor().getId());
}
```

#### When Creating from Post
```java
public void notifyNewPostInCategory(Post post) {
    Notification notification = new Notification(
        UUID.randomUUID().toString(),
        "Có bài viết mới trong chuyên mục",
        post.getSubject().substring(0, Math.min(50, post.getSubject().length())) + "...",
        "NEW_POST_NOTIFICATION",
        false,
        LocalDateTime.now()
    );

    notification.setExtraId(post.getId());  // SET REQUEST ID
    notificationRepo.save(notification);

    // Add to all subscribers
}
```

### 4. DTO Classes

#### CommentDTO
```java
public class CommentDTO {
    private String id;
    private String requestId;  // IMPORTANT
    private String content;
    private LocalDateTime date;
    private String userId;
    private String userRole;
    private String userName;

    // Getters and setters
}
```

#### ReactionDTO
```java
public class ReactionDTO {
    private String id;
    private String requestId;  // IMPORTANT
    private String reactionType;
    private LocalDateTime date;
    private String userId;
    private String userName;

    // Getters and setters
}
```

### 5. Thymeleaf Template Update

Đảm bảo `item.extraId` được truyền vào template:

```html
<!-- staff-notification.html -->
<article class="notification-item"
         th:attr="data-request-id=${item.extraId}">
```

### 6. Notification Mapper (if using MapStruct)

```java
@Mapper
public interface NotificationMapper {
    default NotificationDTO toDTO(Notification entity) {
        NotificationDTO dto = new NotificationDTO();
        dto.setId(entity.getId());
        dto.setTitle(entity.getTitle());
        dto.setContent(entity.getContent());
        dto.setRead(entity.getIsRead());
        dto.setExtraId(entity.getExtraId());  // MAP THIS
        dto.setCreateAt(entity.getCreateAt());

        // Map icon and timeLabel based on type and date
        dto.setIcon(getIcon(entity.getNotificationType()));
        dto.setIconClass(getIconClass(entity.getNotificationType()));
        dto.setTimeLabel(getTimeLabel(entity.getCreateAt()));

        return dto;
    }

    private String getIcon(String type) {
        // Return emoji or icon based on type
        if (type.contains("COMMENT")) return "";
        if (type.contains("VOTE")) return "";
        return "";
    }

    private String getIconClass(String type) {
        if (type.contains("COMMENT")) return "icon-comment";
        if (type.contains("VOTE")) return "icon-vote";
        return "icon-post";
    }

    private String getTimeLabel(LocalDateTime time) {
        // Return relative time like "Hôm nay", "Hôm qua", etc
        LocalDateTime now = LocalDateTime.now();
        Duration duration = Duration.between(time, now);

        if (duration.toHours() < 1) return "Vừa xong";
        if (duration.toDays() == 0) return "Hôm nay";
        if (duration.toDays() == 1) return "Hôm qua";
        if (duration.toDays() < 7) return duration.toDays() + " ngày trước";

        return LocalDate.from(time).toString();
    }
}
```

### 7. Testing Endpoint

```java
@Test
public void testGetComment() {
    String commentId = "comment-123";
    Comment comment = new Comment();
    comment.setId(commentId);
    comment.setContent("Test comment");

    Post post = new Post();
    post.setId("post-456");
    comment.setRequest(post);

    when(commentRepo.findById(commentId)).thenReturn(Optional.of(comment));

    ResponseEntity<CommentDTO> response = forumController.getComment(commentId);

    assertEquals(HttpStatus.OK, response.getStatusCode());
    assertEquals("post-456", response.getBody().getRequestId());
}
```

---

## Checklist

- [ ] Add `extraId` field to Notification entity
- [ ] Create CommentDTO with `requestId`
- [ ] Create ReactionDTO with `requestId`
- [ ] Implement `GET /api/comments/{id}` endpoint
- [ ] Implement `GET /api/reactions/{id}` endpoint
- [ ] Update notification creation to set `extraId`
- [ ] Update Thymeleaf template to use `item.extraId`
- [ ] Create mapper for DTOs
- [ ] Add unit tests
- [ ] Test manually in browser
- [ ] Verify navigation works
- [ ] Check console for errors

---

## Migration (if needed)

If adding new column to existing database:

```sql
-- Add extraId column to notification table
ALTER TABLE notification ADD COLUMN extra_id VARCHAR(255);

-- Update existing notifications with requestId if possible
UPDATE notification n 
SET extra_id = c.request_id 
FROM comment c 
WHERE n.id = c.notification_id;
```

---

## Notes

- `extraId` is used to store the post/request ID for tracing
- All endpoints must return the `requestId` for JavaScript to work
- The JavaScript will use this ID to navigate to `/api/forum/staff/{requestId}`
- Ensure proper error handling for missing data
- Add logging for debugging

---

**Status: Backend checklist ready**
**Next: Implement and test**

/* ===== ROOT ===== */


:root {
    --sidebar-bg: #04163f;
    --sidebar-muted: #9fb5de;
    --sidebar-active: #1f2f50;
    --surface: #f4f7fb;
    --card: #ffffff;
